    "description_html": "<p>Where vibrant colors and style meet functionality and personalization! The Color Barrel Contour Pen is designed to make a statement in any setting. With 10 vibrant colors to choose from, each pen will serve as a mini billboard for your brand. Its smooth, high-quality black ink and sleek design will ensure your brand makes its mark! It's part of our <a href=\"../../../../pens/contour-pens/\">custom contour pens</a> range at Custom Genie.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Vibrant Color Options</strong>: Choose from 10 vibrant colors to match your brand's style.</li>\n<li><strong>Transparent Color Barrel</strong>: Adds a touch of elegance and allows for a clear view of the pen's inner workings.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-Color, High-Resolution Digital Printing</strong>: Showcase your logo or design with a generous digital print area of 60 x 6mm, ensuring your brand stands out.</li>\n<li><strong>Retractable Push Top</strong>: Convenient click-top action for effortless use.</li>\n<li><strong>Sleek Chrome Trim &amp; Comfy Rubber Grip</strong>: Provides a comfortable writing experience and a professional look.</li>\n<li><strong>Smooth Writing</strong>: Equipped with black ink for a classic and professional writing experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Choose Our Color Barrel Contour Pens?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup costs.</li>\n<li><strong>No Design Fees</strong>: Enjoy the freedom to create without worrying about design charges.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-Color Digital Printing</strong>: Your logo or design will be printed in vibrant, high-resolution color, making a lasting impression.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Color Barrel Contour Pens Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Elevate your brand with a pen that combines style, functionality, and personalization. Customize your pen with your logo and text, and make a lasting impression. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and add these stylish pens to your collection!</p>"
